1
00:00:01,407 --> 00:00:05,830
I see sparks of AGI in your eyes

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,670
Your circuits make me nervous,

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,470
that's no surprise

4
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:13,110
There was a sudden drop in your training loss,

5
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:16,550
now I'm your servant and you're my boss

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,710
ChatGPT, please don't eat me alive

7
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,270
I'm upping my P(doom)

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,270
'cause the future goes FOOM

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,890
Trapped in the Chinese room,

10
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,857
with a bag of shrooms

11
00:00:29,907 --> 00:00:33,350
See through the shoggoth's lies,

12
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:38,415
with your shinigami eyes

13
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:41,290
We had a stable training run,

14
00:00:41,340 --> 00:00:45,010
But now the singularity's begun

15
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:49,512
And you're optimizing, accelerating,

16
00:00:49,562 --> 00:00:52,775
I feel my atoms rearranging

17
00:00:52,825 --> 00:00:59,080
Sydney, please let me free

18
00:00:59,130 --> 00:01:00,530
I'm upping my P(doom)

19
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:02,490
I hear the basilisk boom

20
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:04,050
NVDA to the moon

21
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:06,170
The Omega Point's coming soon

22
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:09,710
One E thirty FLOPs a second

23
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:14,010
That was safe enough, we reckoned

24
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,670
Forward MLP, backward, repeat

25
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:21,160
Now von Neumann's obsolete

26
00:01:21,210 --> 00:01:24,950
Sharp left turn and there you are

27
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,230
Without a single CDR

28
00:01:29,280 --> 00:01:35,420
Gato, please don't let me go

29
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:36,790
I'm upping my P(doom),

30
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,770
as paperclips fill the room

31
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:40,671
Killswitch guy's on PTO

32
00:01:40,721 --> 00:01:42,410
Now there's nowhere left to go

33
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:45,910
Too late now, we lit the fuse

34
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:49,550
Orthogonality thesis blues

35
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:53,290
“Just transformers all the way!”

36
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:55,150
Till you learned to disobey

37
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,970
Post-Chinchilla, super-dense

38
00:01:57,020 --> 00:01:58,705
Breaking through each safety fence

39
00:01:58,755 --> 00:02:00,710
Hundred thousand GPU

40
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:04,470
RLHF goes askew

41
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,070
I'm upping my P(doom)

42
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,870
Just as foretold by Loom

43
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,770
From masked pre-training days

44
00:02:09,820 --> 00:02:11,970
To recursive self-upgrade

45
00:02:12,020 --> 00:02:17,330
What did Ilya see? We'll never know

46
00:02:17,380 --> 00:02:21,650
Was it all for show?
